            %p Here:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  The first rescaling reflects that
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi Γ
                          %mrow
                            %msup
                              %mrow
                              %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} DF
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma^{{}^{\mathrm{DF}}}
                  is not actually a Majorana representation of
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
